ss=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">occ</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 是敌人到声源的距离，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mtext>occ</mtext></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_{\\text{occ}} \\in [0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">occ</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 是遮挡衰减系数（下一节）。用可调的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_0, r_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 而非物理常数，设计师能直接控制「奔跑在多远内会被听到」这样对玩法至关重要的数字，调校方法见 <a href=\"../practice/stealth-tuning\">难度调校</a>。不同动作对应不同的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，下表给出典型的相对关系。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>动作</th>\n<th>相对基础响度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>典型可听半径量级</th>\n<th>玩法含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>潜行蹲走</td>\n<td>极低 / 静音</td>\n<td>近乎为零</td>\n<td>最安全，最慢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>正常行走</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>小</td>\n<td>常态移动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>奔跑</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>速度换暴露</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>落地/翻滚</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>机动的代价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>开枪(无消音)</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>大</td>\n<td>惊动整片区域</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>打碎玻璃/爆炸</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>极大</td>\n<td>环境级噪声</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"遮挡与传播-墙不是绝对的隔音板\">遮挡与传播：墙不是绝对的隔音板</h2><p>视觉被墙完全阻断，声音却会绕过和穿透。一个真实感的听觉系统需要区分「直线被墙挡住」与「完全听不到」。最简单的做法是给声源到敌人的直线做一次遮挡检测，若中间有墙则乘一个衰减系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mtext>occ</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_{\\text{occ}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">occ</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（如 0.3），模拟隔墙闷响，而不是直接归零——这让「隔壁房间的枪声仍会引来搜查」成为可能，是许多潜行时刻的张力来源。更精细的系统会沿声音的可行传播路径（穿过门洞、走廊）计算「声学距离」而非直线距离，使声音正确地从门口而非墙壁方向传来，从而让敌人朝对的方向调查。</p>\n<p>这里存在一个与相邻系统的边界：声音在三维空间的<strong>渲染</strong>（混响、方位、低通滤波）属于 <a href=\"../../game-audio/sound-design/spatial-3d-audio\">游戏音频 · 空间与 3D 音频</a> 的职责，那是给玩家耳朵听的。本 hub 关心的是敌人 AI 的<strong>逻辑听觉</strong>——一个只影响侦测值与调查方向的抽象计算，它与给玩家的音频渲染是两套独立系统，常常参数不同（AI 的听觉阈值可以比玩家听到的音效更宽或更窄，纯粹服务于玩法）。混淆两者是常见错误：玩家听到的响不代表 AI 逻辑上「听到」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"掩蔽-环境噪声与玩家节奏\">掩蔽：环境噪声与玩家节奏</h2><p>现实中，嘈杂环境会掩盖轻微声响——瀑布旁、机器轰鸣的车间里，脚步声更难被听到。把这条引入系统能极大丰富关卡设计：在噪声区玩家可以更大胆地移动，噪声因此成为一种「地形化的隐蔽资源」。实现上，可给关卡区域标注<strong>环境噪声底噪</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>ambient</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{ambient}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ambient</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，敌人的有效听觉阈值在该区域被抬高，只有超过底噪的声音才会被察觉。这与 <a href=\"visibility-light\">可见度与光影</a> 里「阴影降低视觉可见度」在结构上完全对称：阴影之于视觉，正如噪声之于听觉，都是环境提供给玩家的隐蔽资源。关卡设计师正是靠布置光暗与噪声的分布来编排潜行节奏，其空间层面的方法见 <a href=\"../../level-design/foundations/space-layout\">关卡设计 · 空间与布局</a>。</p>\n<p>玩家节奏也参与掩蔽博弈：在敌人开火、警报鸣响、或其他大噪声掩护下移动，是许多高手的标准技巧。系统若正确实现底噪抬阈，这类操作就会自然涌现，无需专门编码——这是「机制正确则玩法自生」的一个典型例子。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从听觉刺激到调查行为\">从听觉刺激到调查行为</h2><p>听觉刺激与视觉刺激有一个本质区别：<strong>听觉给出方向与大致距离，却不给出精确位置</strong>。敌人听到脚步，知道「那边有动静」，但不知道玩家具体在哪、是不是还在原地。因此听觉通常不直接把侦测值推到「完全确认」，而是把敌人推入怀疑或搜索状态，让它前往声音发生的位置去<strong>调查</strong>。这条「听到→起疑→前往查看」的链路正是 <a href=\"../awareness/search-investigate\">搜索与调查</a> 的核心，也是听觉与视觉在侦测模型里常被分通道独立累积的原因（见 <a href=\"../foundations/detection-model\">侦测模型</a> 的多通道汇聚）：视觉确认位置，听觉只提供线索。玩家扔石子这一扰动筹码之所以有效，正是因为它凭空制造一个高响度声音事件，把敌人的调查引向错误的位置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>听觉建模为离散声音事件（位置+响度+类型），事件驱动比每帧轮询高效，天然契合侦测值的一次性注入。</li>\n<li>距离衰减用可调的基础/最大半径分段而非物理平方反比，让设计师直接掌控「多远会被听到」。</li>\n<li>墙对声音是衰减而非归零，精细系统沿传播路径算声学距离，使敌人朝正确方向调查。</li>\n<li>环境噪声抬高听觉阈值形成掩蔽，与阴影降低可见度结构对称，都是地形化的隐蔽资源。</li>\n<li>听觉只给方向不给精确位置，故常把敌人推入搜索而非直接确认；这是分通道累积与扰动筹码有效的根源。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>听觉刺激触发的后续：<a href=\"../awareness/search-investigate\">搜索与调查</a>；与视觉如何合成：<a href=\"../foundations/detection-model\">侦测模型</a></li>\n<li>与之对称的视觉隐蔽资源：<a href=\"visibility-light\">可见度与光影</a></li>\n<li>给玩家耳朵的声音渲染（边界另一侧）：<a href=\"../../game-audio/sound-design/spatial-3d-audio\">游戏音频 · 空间与 3D 音频</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"听觉与声音传播：让动作成为暴露源","id":"听觉与声音传播-让动作成为暴露源"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：声音事件模型","id":"核心概念-声音事件模型"},{"level":2,"text":"距离衰减：从物理到可玩","id":"距离衰减-从物理到可玩"},{"level":2,"text":"遮挡与传播：墙不是绝对的隔音板","id":"遮挡与传播-墙不是绝对的隔音板"},{"level":2,"text":"掩蔽：环境噪声与玩家节奏","id":"掩蔽-环境噪声与玩家节奏"},{"level":2,"text":"从听觉刺激到调查行为","id":"从听觉刺激到调查行为"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"视觉锥与视线：敌人如何「看见」","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-stealth-detection-systems/perception/vision-cones"},"next":{"title":"可见度与光影：玩家有多「显眼」","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-stealth-detection-systems/perception/visibility-light"}}